_dragview","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output ","type":"text"},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the layer’s transform. The rendered view uses the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"centered 220×140 tan card, 888×1212 artboard, and full-bleed framing as the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub macOS runner evidence bound to this head."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onKeyPress(phases:action:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"onKeyPress(phases:action:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onKeyPress(phases:action:)","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/onkeypress(phases:action:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onKeyPress","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"phases","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyPress","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Phases","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV6PhasesV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"action","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyPress","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyPress","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV6ResultO"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]}}}